window.EXAUD={"Work in pairs and act out the dialogue.": "audio/cau/9f80b4a8118b33e2.mp3", "We must act quickly to save water.": "audio/cau/2f2b0156a6f07db9.mp3", "We need to take action to keep our school clean.": "audio/cau/0c8076052760d1f1.mp3", "Lan is very active, and her quick action helped her friend.": "audio/cau/aa0ee4199314c27b.mp3", "My little brother is very active.": "audio/cau/ee888778c322e79a.mp3", "Hoa is active and enjoys every club activity.": "audio/cau/a7bbb816806174db.mp3", "She actively takes part in class.": "audio/cau/3744bd9a9d414fa7.mp3", "We actively help clean the beach.": "audio/cau/886d6508a571df0e.mp3", "We do many fun activities at the weekend.": "audio/cau/996d76bf4c31cea3.mp3", "Mi is very active and loves outdoor activities.": "audio/cau/94fea0819039eaa4.mp3", "Swimming is my favourite activity.": "audio/cau/f1504092a266a13a.mp3", "Hoa is an active girl, and dancing is her best activity.": "audio/cau/3d7dcf03c6c96451.mp3", "My aim is to speak English well.": "audio/cau/4e6cc3255e109d30.mp3", "The club aims to help poor children.": "audio/cau/2a4c4962cfadb256.mp3", "The air in the countryside is fresh.": "audio/cau/c976ff78f2c2738c.mp3", "Open the window to let some fresh air in.": "audio/cau/d1639d8ab7bbcd46.mp3", "Noi Bai Airport is in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/282019109c12eb03.mp3", "We took a taxi to the airport to catch our plane.": "audio/cau/e094ed7f1a8da89a.mp3", "The two sisters look alike.": "audio/cau/adc5d16e3a95923c.mp3", "No two people are exactly alike.": "audio/cau/bd46ef9712c752ec.mp3", "We must keep our traditional crafts alive.": "audio/cau/461c910cfd0f1264.mp3", "The old tree is still alive, but that one is dead.": "audio/cau/713514d344b69a38.mp3", "My mother always gets up early.": "audio/cau/018f205f8d900a21.mp3", "Nam always does his homework, but he never watches TV late.": "audio/cau/bed514ec413923ae.mp3", "I am a student at Kim Dong School.": "audio/cau/7c9effe742362b92.mp3", "I am in Class 6A, and my friends are in 6B.": "audio/cau/69bce6abc68e1822.mp3", "What animal room would you like to create?": "audio/cau/5e05fc71d8b0c067.mp3", "A tiger is a big animal.": "audio/cau/d1413c566bc88fdb.mp3", "My brother loves drawing animals.": "audio/cau/05c49969296ecc10.mp3", "A cat is a small animal, but an elephant is big.": "audio/cau/6225cb8856b5304b.mp3", "Please answer the teacher's question.": "audio/cau/f790ccdd60f40ece.mp3", "Nam asks and Hoa answers.": "audio/cau/128cffcafde831b9.mp3", "Check your answers with a partner.": "audio/cau/8656910f569b2925.mp3", "Lan can answer all the questions, and her answers are correct.": "audio/cau/df2a478d26596242.mp3", "Mai is anxious about her English test.": "audio/cau/f9281ebe04774242.mp3", "Don't be anxious. You studied well.": "audio/cau/d49951b47e4a4d49.mp3", "Mi and Nam are in Class 6A.": "audio/cau/b0d165e52ca7dc85.mp3", "We are happy today, and Lan is happy too.": "audio/cau/9718e7702bade08e.mp3", "There are many craft villages in this area.": "audio/cau/98ee869d0d985485.mp3", "Our area has a park, and other areas have big markets.": "audio/cau/f0c0742faaa22708.mp3", "Some areas of the city are very crowded.": "audio/cau/4154bcc5089d94ca.mp3", "This area is quiet, but other areas are noisy.": "audio/cau/69ea3ec6b58e98ab.mp3", "You can ask your teacher for help.": "audio/cau/675c99f05fae3d5e.mp3", "Phong asked a question, and Mi answered it.": "audio/cau/ad374096f949206b.mp3", "Nam asked his teacher a question.": "audio/cau/4879a0b703b8484f.mp3", "Mi asks a lot of questions; yesterday she asked ten.": "audio/cau/1884bf7fdb16c86c.mp3", "Lan is asking her mother about dinner.": "audio/cau/28eda1c06b5eacae.mp3", "Nam asks a lot, and now he is asking again.": "audio/cau/c563c3f4819710c9.mp3", "Minh asks his friend for a pen.": "audio/cau/463760cf3bb33508.mp3", "Hoa often asks questions, and yesterday she asked ten.": "audio/cau/99ce048ae007844f.mp3", "I attend Le Loi Secondary School.": "audio/cau/2106fb1a21b48167.mp3", "Many people attended the festival.": "audio/cau/d86fc7a983ad38ca.mp3", "Please pay attention to the teacher.": "audio/cau/9cbf379be0e4f13b.mp3", "Lan is an attentive student who pays attention in class.": "audio/cau/991bd7e8b14790af.mp3", "Be attentive in class.": "audio/cau/4c32da426c39662a.mp3", "She is an attentive listener.": "audio/cau/59ab0971a228f869.mp3", "Who is the author of this book?": "audio/cau/307f149b72d48019.mp3", "To Hoai is a famous author.": "audio/cau/e04eb4b941758460.mp3", "The average age of the class is 12.": "audio/cau/88cc3876de3fb381.mp3", "On average, I sleep eight hours a day.": "audio/cau/f790bf42c68fcb51.mp3", "The weather was awful yesterday.": "audio/cau/18c5597f08aedf94.mp3", "What an awful smell!": "audio/cau/96bfd05e078fcb90.mp3", "Look at picture b and answer.": "audio/cau/b2672a8a1898ddda.mp3", "Write the letter b next to the right answer.": "audio/cau/9ec7b58bf879e0bc.mp3", "Eating too much sugar is bad for your teeth.": "audio/cau/385b55508b3849c3.mp3", "The traffic was bad today, but yesterday it was worse.": "audio/cau/4db5861a9ee30736.mp3", "The city was badly affected by the flood.": "audio/cau/1e256308778b183a.mp3", "Nam played badly today, but yesterday he played worse.": "audio/cau/c2078c45e0d95aa8.mp3", "Try to keep a balance between study and play.": "audio/cau/44d0699cbae934ba.mp3", "A balanced diet helps you keep a good balance in life.": "audio/cau/20a258cd4a2dfe22.mp3", "Teens need a balanced diet.": "audio/cau/450d598d5b10f035.mp3", "Mi studies and rests well, so her life has a good balance.": "audio/cau/ade55945770daac6.mp3", "My grandfather makes baskets from bamboo.": "audio/cau/570bf04fb5e0d256.mp3", "Bamboo grows fast, and artisans use it to make many things.": "audio/cau/ffc642fbc938aee9.mp3", "Please be quiet in the library.": "audio/cau/d6fab02a2655be4e.mp3", "I want to be a doctor. My sister is a nurse.": "audio/cau/e31166f3ca032296.mp3", "She became a famous writer at the age of 30.": "audio/cau/d039f1fb340db200.mp3", "Nam's father became a doctor, and Nam wants to become one.": "audio/cau/75c8536f0f8b5b1b.mp3", "The city has become more crowded.": "audio/cau/e4616f3fdd933bf4.mp3", "Lan became a teacher, and her brother will become a doctor.": "audio/cau/534acc7a3aea852d.mp3", "Our lessons begin at seven o'clock.": "audio/cau/7e2700abcf553879.mp3", "The film began at 8 p.m. and finished at 10 p.m.": "audio/cau/27d24f5e96b08bae.mp3", "I ride my bicycle to school every day.": "audio/cau/dcdb6e0b40d1db18.mp3", "Nam's bicycle is new, and he loves his bike.": "audio/cau/11b6650e5706243d.mp3", "Lan rides her bike to school.": "audio/cau/80133585ffee2230.mp3", "My bike is old, so Dad bought me a new bicycle.": "audio/cau/24ad75c6338c2de3.mp3", "Many students ride bikes to school.": "audio/cau/d465f6c242f32ec4.mp3", "My bike is blue, and my friends' bikes are red.": "audio/cau/c3cd23ea2efb7340.mp3", "Exercise is good for your body.": "audio/cau/c752373dc0832e44.mp3", "Draw a person and label the parts of the body.": "audio/cau/136aee3e397e928c.mp3", "Look at the words in bold in the text.": "audio/cau/b50caf0d921a5e1e.mp3", "The bold words are new, so please read them aloud.": "audio/cau/3d1628780166f0c1.mp3", "Lang Son is near the Chinese border.": "audio/cau/0edb582fb1ab073e.mp3", "The card has a gold border.": "audio/cau/195ec3816246723b.mp3", "The film was long and boring.": "audio/cau/2fb37c98bad76a4f.mp3", "The lesson was boring, so Nam felt bored.": "audio/cau/0b9b11807d964d8b.mp3", "Can I borrow your pen?": "audio/cau/1be36a30e71062e9.mp3", "I borrow books from the library.": "audio/cau/ce0cd956864285f8.mp3", "There is a cat in the box.": "audio/cau/2e85eeb9526b3b0e.mp3", "Put the toys in the box; we have three boxes.": "audio/cau/94612872a7e7c8fc.mp3", "The toys are in the boxes.": "audio/cau/170d9e1f4536be5e.mp3", "Mai puts her books in two boxes.": "audio/cau/895f5119e1e2f239.mp3", "Hoa is a bright student.": "audio/cau/505049821b13285a.mp3", "The sun shines brightly on a bright morning.": "audio/cau/8688428d91bd1a20.mp3", "Please bring your English book tomorrow.": "audio/cau/cd49561735d6690b.mp3", "Exams can bring about a lot of stress.": "audio/cau/4bcd1f108e558b55.mp3", "The craft village brings jobs to local people.": "audio/cau/0e7f9b2836ed98fa.mp3", "Tourism brings money, and last year it brought many visitors.": "audio/cau/c12b6a42eae46d36.mp3", "She brought a cake to the party.": "audio/cau/4c498283c3f41d5f.mp3", "I brought my umbrella today.": "audio/cau/3183089802d63874.mp3", "My mum is always busy at weekends.": "audio/cau/e860f8923617b0aa.mp3", "Hoa is busy today, but she is free tomorrow.": "audio/cau/1d5a0a62fb11072c.mp3", "The correct answer is c.": "audio/cau/115cc222c2d7fb6e.mp3", "Look at picture c and describe the girl.": "audio/cau/a211a53ea5c1cc24.mp3", "I call my grandparents every Sunday.": "audio/cau/2d274e78a6c843f7.mp3", "Mi phoned Lan, but Lan didn't answer the call.": "audio/cau/5828a7c8ea6b7c57.mp3", "He started a company called Sun Tech.": "audio/cau/201ec774149f9db7.mp3", "Nam called me last night, and I call him every week.": "audio/cau/4e3a47db5686e0e1.mp3", "The caller asked for my mother.": "audio/cau/3b0159f33675d877.mp3", "The first caller wins a prize.": "audio/cau/96bea6f7e7871b46.mp3", "My village is calm and green.": "audio/cau/bc7c091bd908318d.mp3", "The streets are calm and quiet at night.": "audio/cau/2a74b9e92030e5a3.mp3", "She answered calmly.": "audio/cau/c0bc67ad5450e5d5.mp3", "Walk out calmly when there is a fire.": "audio/cau/fad079b435374c70.mp3", "I admire his calmness.": "audio/cau/005245e1abe4ac55.mp3", "Yoga brings calmness.": "audio/cau/68f38a4c896ebb4a.mp3", "Mi can swim very well.": "audio/cau/3e8edac082144330.mp3", "I can ride a bike now, but last year I couldn't.": "audio/cau/af33705bbc26781d.mp3", "Too many cars cause traffic jams.": "audio/cau/5ac4cbb3cb2d00fb.mp3", "Pollution is a cause of illness and can cause problems.": "audio/cau/b0502415132a3591.mp3", "The heavy rain caused floods in the city.": "audio/cau/dcdc2e71dafdf9ae.mp3", "Traffic jams often cause stress, and yesterday they caused delays.": "audio/cau/a326ce14c20dc2bf.mp3", "Noise causes stress for city people.": "audio/cau/c4c32fd3a6bdffe8.mp3", "Too much sugar causes health problems.": "audio/cau/23846d4c8dfddc2f.mp3", "We live in a central part of the city.": "audio/cau/56cb7cd26e890a65.mp3", "The central market is near the city centre.": "audio/cau/d3670c2095eba83a.mp3", "Our hotel is centrally located.": "audio/cau/3c523ccb5b5109f7.mp3", "The school is centrally placed in the town.": "audio/cau/408f3799a462b80c.mp3", "There is a community centre in my area.": "audio/cau/29303f0e938051fb.mp3", "The city centre is busy, and the central park is big.": "audio/cau/d087f6159981d3e2.mp3", "I am certain that she will come.": "audio/cau/25c0f3ef17d323c0.mp3", "Certain foods are bad for your teeth.": "audio/cau/1ab9e45b6a569a34.mp3", "My bike chain is broken.": "audio/cau/d415975c511d570d.mp3", "This is a chain of fast food restaurants.": "audio/cau/c895da38511af5c7.mp3", "One good teacher can change your life.": "audio/cau/a24566287e5a310e.mp3", "The city changed a lot, and the change is good.": "audio/cau/c2d3e45906274d36.mp3", "The weather in spring is changeable.": "audio/cau/da8f6cf3533cf6e8.mp3", "His mood is very changeable.": "audio/cau/d761822654a22f3f.mp3", "I often chat with my neighbours.": "audio/cau/f9bdc10e4250f241.mp3", "Mi and Lan had a long chat after school.": "audio/cau/92771962baaa6db3.mp3", "Mi checked her work, and the check took ten minutes.": "audio/cau/53e04ae5ad0ce9eb.mp3", "You have a choice of tea or juice.": "audio/cau/d83c640d99d55e18.mp3", "I think you made a good choice.": "audio/cau/89c0a3eddbcb6efd.mp3", "Choose the correct answer.": "audio/cau/9bb3b69b3f099527.mp3", "Mi chose a red pen. It was a good choice.": "audio/cau/4fabb83c5ec962f5.mp3", "I help my mum with the chores.": "audio/cau/ec58d4ed18c9c760.mp3", "Doing chores is my duty at weekends.": "audio/cau/09249f9d1a1fd9c1.mp3", "I chose the bus because it is cheap.": "audio/cau/9c85ffa2fb7223db.mp3", "You can choose one, and Nam chose the red one.": "audio/cau/3684e06d8810f79f.mp3", "She was chosen as class monitor.": "audio/cau/77ca45b3c93c0c06.mp3", "Have you chosen a book yet?": "audio/cau/69586b45796a6e5b.mp3", "Circle the correct words in the sentences.": "audio/cau/b29e7fa52f670dcd.mp3", "Draw a circle and write your name in it.": "audio/cau/81c28a695a36caf8.mp3", "We sat at a circular table.": "audio/cau/488af9b1205b61bc.mp3", "The stadium has a circular shape.": "audio/cau/cbc5d23a59b2b100.mp3", "Big cities often have traffic jams.": "audio/cau/290573a9de9b8727.mp3", "Ha Noi is a city, and Hue is a city too.": "audio/cau/723b5f4c4ced8460.mp3", "Every citizen should obey the law.": "audio/cau/ea7f4c7f2b1f7427.mp3", "He is a Vietnamese citizen.": "audio/cau/e80d176ec8a69643.mp3", "I live in a big city.": "audio/cau/66e0022bec290560.mp3", "Life in the city is busier than in the countryside.": "audio/cau/ec0678a3bad99639.mp3", "Thanks to garbage collectors, our streets are clean.": "audio/cau/daef4e3fa0819a5e.mp3", "We clean the streets every weekend.": "audio/cau/d0801c735785b87e.mp3", "The cleaner works early in the morning.": "audio/cau/2d62413dec6c90b6.mp3", "The street cleaner cleans the road every day.": "audio/cau/e156ac2a11c8608f.mp3", "Việt Nam has a tropical climate.": "audio/cau/6120a67624262656.mp3", "Climate change is a big problem.": "audio/cau/bfc6f897b4bf43f6.mp3", "It is cloudy today.": "audio/cau/104c622aeb04ba8e.mp3", "On cloudy days, I stay at home.": "audio/cau/cdf42e2db75bc0dd.mp3", "I came down with a cold last week.": "audio/cau/6589d8d2056f15e9.mp3", "It is cold in Ha Noi in winter.": "audio/cau/6af5e5587fe6cf7a.mp3", "I can feel the coldness of the water.": "audio/cau/23d48b220795c5bf.mp3", "Her coldness made him sad.": "audio/cau/681563c4a0ca6a61.mp3", "Bánh mì is a combination of bread and meat.": "audio/cau/593d5f3edf924e37.mp3", "Green is a combination of blue and yellow.": "audio/cau/72d561ae5b3f63a0.mp3", "Complete the sentences with the words.": "audio/cau/a10abe8427f587a5.mp3", "Mi completed her homework. Now it is complete.": "audio/cau/e89d49e3a54806e8.mp3", "Lan completely forgot her friend's birthday.": "audio/cau/ae968fd2ecb01b87.mp3", "Minh completely forgot about his homework.": "audio/cau/4ec9cda7a9209eb1.mp3", "Nam plans his time well to ensure timely completion of his project.": "audio/cau/dc9f46bca5bd24cf.mp3", "After the completion of the test, Hoa felt relaxed.": "audio/cau/8159d955f47b0ba3.mp3", "Lan concentrates on the most urgent task first.": "audio/cau/921a7ff233827ef2.mp3", "Minh can't concentrate when his phone is on.": "audio/cau/d4e473339e819b15.mp3", "Our classroom is air-conditioned.": "audio/cau/bea299b026bb8031.mp3", "We stayed in an air-conditioned room.": "audio/cau/7fc9ae4ac9535ae5.mp3", "The content of your presentation is good.": "audio/cau/c850bbe3d276a084.mp3", "Check the contents page to find the content you need.": "audio/cau/b34ad351582873cf.mp3", "Choose the correct answer A, B or C.": "audio/cau/6f45c31e9ee537be.mp3", "Nam's answer is correct, but mine is wrong.": "audio/cau/2f88ef38a2385ee5.mp3", "The teacher made corrections in red.": "audio/cau/895634813fdf81d2.mp3", "Check your corrections carefully.": "audio/cau/c829f7ab4f978d5b.mp3", "Try to say these new words correctly.": "audio/cau/d4da04af4337ec0f.mp3", "Her answer is correct because she read the question correctly.": "audio/cau/cee1de65a2a9d88f.mp3", "Viet Nam is a beautiful country.": "audio/cau/df0215608f1e8de4.mp3", "My grandparents live in the countryside of our country.": "audio/cau/00375e3b63fb00b1.mp3", "Life in the countryside is peaceful.": "audio/cau/95479ebba178019f.mp3", "The city is noisy, but the countryside is quiet.": "audio/cau/37f198fe8e1a722b.mp3", "Bat Trang is famous for its pottery craft.": "audio/cau/03c5d939c8d29b0b.mp3", "The craftsmen in my village keep the old craft alive.": "audio/cau/39d4e1c95add96e3.mp3", "Lan creates a to-do list every Sunday evening.": "audio/cau/87a26e3235a8f368.mp3", "Our class created a poster about healthy living.": "audio/cau/97dc8c8a67b315e5.mp3", "Please cut the paper into small pieces.": "audio/cau/a1fd8b0ff53be3ae.mp3", "Yesterday Nam cut the cake for his friends.": "audio/cau/97279c7011b57f8b.mp3", "Use a paper cutter carefully.": "audio/cau/e32df5377a73513b.mp3", "Mum has a cookie cutter shaped like a star.": "audio/cau/dc1ab9c2ecff77a5.mp3", "My dad is cutting the grass in the garden.": "audio/cau/de769b78036d1e0b.mp3", "We are cutting down on plastic bags, and last month we cut down on paper too.": "audio/cau/9f9ddd6ec177ddbf.mp3", "I cycle to school every day.": "audio/cau/1131e233c7995091.mp3", "Hoa is a good cyclist, and she can cycle very fast.": "audio/cau/77372027f155fac8.mp3", "The cyclist wore a helmet.": "audio/cau/48c284f1664109d2.mp3", "He is a professional cyclist.": "audio/cau/89b3aeb591c375d2.mp3", "Look at picture d and answer the question.": "audio/cau/cd1db823a64876e3.mp3", "Choose answer d, then write it in your notebook.": "audio/cau/d8924058670ef40e.mp3", "My dad is a doctor.": "audio/cau/87de43de098d8ab6.mp3", "My dad cooks dinner, and my mum washes the dishes.": "audio/cau/8ca0dad82745ad96.mp3", "Traffic jams are part of daily life in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/c95ad670d219bd23.mp3", "Nam reads the news daily, every day before school.": "audio/cau/7ddb05aad387c96a.mp3", "I have English every day.": "audio/cau/50a9802d88a8dbc0.mp3", "Nam studies by day and sleeps at night.": "audio/cau/0f498730d8ee8697.mp3", "There are seven days in a week.": "audio/cau/4193126d14e614a3.mp3", "I study English daily, even on busy days.": "audio/cau/f6f890f7b3bda2bf.mp3", "The plant is dead because I forgot to water it.": "audio/cau/bd6933cd22810bf6.mp3", "My phone battery is dead.": "audio/cau/cb93d3711c2b9485.mp3", "The death of his dog made him sad.": "audio/cau/16557e1350bb02d1.mp3", "Smoking can cause death.": "audio/cau/e5da19be59040040.mp3", "The fire destroyed the old house.": "audio/cau/36cb28d95071f932.mp3", "Pollution destroys the environment.": "audio/cau/b351f0817a25406e.mp3", "I did my homework last night.": "audio/cau/52c1dc6ad84a16a5.mp3", "Did you do the project? Yes, I did.": "audio/cau/ce2a17ba3a5d2ade.mp3", "A plant dies if it gets no light.": "audio/cau/9c2443edfe83c3d6.mp3", "The hero never dies in the story.": "audio/cau/f34fc80ee7ab3fd0.mp3", "My house is different from yours.": "audio/cau/5abda8894fc87510.mp3", "Lan and Mi are different; the difference is their hobbies.": "audio/cau/fd7e006914631783.mp3", "There is dirt on your shoes.": "audio/cau/d360a0d04782b35c.mp3", "The dirt from the building site makes the street dirty.": "audio/cau/43a785de1e1d3309.mp3", "The air in big cities is dirty.": "audio/cau/286767588a10e6b5.mp3", "Wash your dirty hands to remove the dirt.": "audio/cau/400fb6184b406956.mp3", "Let's discuss the problem in groups.": "audio/cau/cef13322a0d3b68b.mp3", "We discuss the plan, and the discussion takes ten minutes.": "audio/cau/a31966bdeac63e89.mp3", "We had a discussion about city life.": "audio/cau/d84c065603f75017.mp3", "After the discussion, we discussed it again with our teacher.": "audio/cau/054b4021e8aa37b4.mp3", "What is the distance from your house to school?": "audio/cau/c31773e8a12f8e54.mp3", "My school is a short distance away, not distant at all.": "audio/cau/6dcd5ee2374d5448.mp3", "They live in a distant village.": "audio/cau/293570b1a9cba6f8.mp3", "I can see distant mountains.": "audio/cau/bf005a049b021a82.mp3", "I do my homework after dinner.": "audio/cau/dfa2558950305f83.mp3", "Phong did his homework, and now it is done.": "audio/cau/4e496982963ec9df.mp3", "Does Lan like ice cream?": "audio/cau/15298c934c7dedf6.mp3", "Nam does his homework, but he doesn't watch TV.": "audio/cau/16100881d98fba74.mp3", "Mi doesn't like milk very much.": "audio/cau/63a58b0dc618ef2d.mp3", "Nam does his homework, but Minh doesn't do it.": "audio/cau/362bb11ca0696388.mp3", "What are you doing now?": "audio/cau/cc6dbef7715013a7.mp3", "Lan is doing her homework, and she did the maths yesterday.": "audio/cau/c6619d790ec63e61.mp3", "I have done my homework.": "audio/cau/319d28fa8d112271.mp3", "Nam did the test well; he has done a great job.": "audio/cau/a6f61635ce93b0e4.mp3", "Please sit down on the chair.": "audio/cau/08cb6a07df1ed303.mp3", "The cat jumps up and then comes down.": "audio/cau/009acd9ad7b1a705.mp3", "Many people in Da Nang work downtown.": "audio/cau/937a590a251089b9.mp3", "Lan lives downtown, near the city centre market.": "audio/cau/ac4b9b9bb5e89502.mp3", "Can you draw a cat?": "audio/cau/be2932fbc93e80e5.mp3", "Hoa drew a flower and gave me the drawing.": "audio/cau/8ef26c64079b1115.mp3", "Lan's drawing is on the wall.": "audio/cau/e1c99913c9bb1dcf.mp3", "Minh draws well. He drew this drawing yesterday.": "audio/cau/a06a821e60587e14.mp3", "My brother draws pictures of animals.": "audio/cau/f72f002c0ce9c3b5.mp3", "Mi draws every day, and last week she drew a horse.": "audio/cau/c53f78fbfbf3ff78.mp3", "He drew a cat on the board.": "audio/cau/60aeb1a679f13bef.mp3", "We drew pictures in the art lesson.": "audio/cau/cffb3f0aaad7fa4f.mp3", "The drought killed many plants.": "audio/cau/07883f57d0de442a.mp3", "Farmers are worried about the drought.": "audio/cau/2565968b3964f991.mp3", "Droughts and floods are natural disasters.": "audio/cau/a2624ffc366a92ea.mp3", "This area often has droughts in summer.": "audio/cau/78a79aa64f8d3afc.mp3", "Do exercise e on page ten.": "audio/cau/f397a6a2157f10ba.mp3", "The word 'eye' starts with the letter e.": "audio/cau/5f2132c30b4b4b2f.mp3", "The Earth goes around the Sun.": "audio/cau/e9deae5a50bf8484.mp3", "We must protect the Earth.": "audio/cau/c5818b11faf951cb.mp3", "The Earth's surface is mostly water.": "audio/cau/399c8df06a363890.mp3", "Trees help the Earth's air stay clean.": "audio/cau/2678850161292d46.mp3", "We eat rice every day.": "audio/cau/e1b9f1e0ff973ad1.mp3", "We eat rice today, but yesterday we ate pho.": "audio/cau/575ec69b6a817f1a.mp3", "Cutting trees causes ecological problems.": "audio/cau/d0a7e57b44380cd9.mp3", "This forest has great ecological value.": "audio/cau/7546ccc91c254e98.mp3", "My uncle drives an electric car.": "audio/cau/52df4e3dfc66f6a2.mp3", "We have an electric cooker at home.": "audio/cau/b5b3927a68dc7c09.mp3", "At the end of the story, he became a hero.": "audio/cau/4cef74a2fd4fb11a.mp3", "We read to the end, and the ending was happy.": "audio/cau/fc827bfa0e26aa94.mp3", "Our PE teacher is very energetic.": "audio/cau/0f20bc2cdf1fdbbc.mp3", "I feel energetic after a good sleep.": "audio/cau/38346e6197dce33e.mp3", "Solar energy is clean and safe.": "audio/cau/12d6baefa67435a0.mp3", "Hoa is energetic and full of energy.": "audio/cau/708c08d09ae44b32.mp3", "We have English on Monday.": "audio/cau/6e580c9a3bf7deb6.mp3", "Nam wants to study English in England.": "audio/cau/babe058c930ffd1c.mp3", "I spent the entire day at home.": "audio/cau/edb66e800ba6c4c2.mp3", "The entire class went on the trip.": "audio/cau/f92c63bf4d359ad1.mp3", "We must protect the environment.": "audio/cau/1116c335bfe25163.mp3", "Plastic waste is a big environmental problem.": "audio/cau/e0cb17c748b83922.mp3", "Our class joined an environmental club.": "audio/cau/3c1f95563319cdf0.mp3", "Cooking is an everyday activity for my mum.": "audio/cau/03801a514b91f476.mp3", "We use everyday English every day at school.": "audio/cau/61f0eab70fe5dd6e.mp3", "City life is exciting for teens.": "audio/cau/28945e456a70e4ca.mp3", "The trip was exciting, so we were very excited.": "audio/cau/53c60dbfd0e789cf.mp3", "\"Break a leg\" is an English expression.": "audio/cau/03d61dde951cfe19.mp3", "Her facial expression showed she was sad.": "audio/cau/ce988b82d9baac3c.mp3", "Learn these useful expressions by heart.": "audio/cau/f77071b27c197d14.mp3", "Use expressions to show surprise.": "audio/cau/349580710e59c8ae.mp3", "The test was extremely difficult.": "audio/cau/ccc534030337d3ca.mp3", "I'm extremely happy to see you.": "audio/cau/6c7b609f63941630.mp3", "Write T for true or F for false.": "audio/cau/d086c486993b428b.mp3", "Sentence 2 is false, so Nam writes F.": "audio/cau/87a27d221b2ce0ec.mp3", "Wash your face before breakfast.": "audio/cau/b40392145a1b9e72.mp3", "Hoa has a round face, and we draw funny faces.": "audio/cau/bed7bfe736a05e74.mp3", "The children have happy faces.": "audio/cau/326d20380efdc287.mp3", "Phong has an oval face. Look at our faces in the photo.": "audio/cau/f76c0b6fc6a16fb9.mp3", "His facial expression showed he was angry.": "audio/cau/7d1a424cbbfd0671.mp3", "Emojis copy our facial expressions.": "audio/cau/2ec8636c8fa6f1d7.mp3", "Smoke from factories makes the air dirty.": "audio/cau/c81ab4e4468cc59e.mp3", "My uncle works in a shoe factory near Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/cadf22ae030695ea.mp3", "This factory makes bikes and motorbikes.": "audio/cau/f3c9616567191f5a.mp3", "There are many factories in the industrial zone.": "audio/cau/a1bac638f590bcae.mp3", "The singer found fame at a young age.": "audio/cau/38e4c711b20f4bb0.mp3", "Money and fame don't bring happiness.": "audio/cau/f2341314eb013e00.mp3", "Hoi An is famous for its lanterns.": "audio/cau/be0831db3c3bf621.mp3", "General Giap became famous, and his fame spread worldwide.": "audio/cau/4eabd5e77fd10a06.mp3", "We had a fantastic holiday.": "audio/cau/f32cf4ee7488001e.mp3", "The view from the top is fantastic.": "audio/cau/e447250983ededde.mp3", "My grandparents have a small farm in the countryside.": "audio/cau/8dfbf1cdb8c722b6.mp3", "The farmer feeds the chickens on his farm.": "audio/cau/b7fa5397f8451fd9.mp3", "My grandfather is a farmer.": "audio/cau/f239e4800637ead0.mp3", "The farmer grows rice and vegetables.": "audio/cau/13650e5e5af7b7b8.mp3", "My father is a doctor in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/ad3b88cec9d38c40.mp3", "Hoa's father and grandfather are both farmers.": "audio/cau/86e9c9df994f954c.mp3", "Cuc Phuong has rich flora and fauna.": "audio/cau/87d03299c18782ab.mp3", "We studied the fauna of the island.": "audio/cau/078d5ba034c4518a.mp3", "I feed my cat twice a day.": "audio/cau/3a8f8f8f00f1daf9.mp3", "Yesterday Lan fed the fish in the pond.": "audio/cau/01b9c59f1a6a6265.mp3", "Grandpa is feeding the chickens now.": "audio/cau/53aec0aca2247225.mp3", "Mi feeds the cat every morning; today she fed it early.": "audio/cau/b5dc31c455add430.mp3", "I can't find my pencil.": "audio/cau/8c42ffdede29d976.mp3", "Lan lost her key, but Nam found it.": "audio/cau/59b8a65c0d818025.mp3", "I finish my homework before dinner.": "audio/cau/4c12023029931700.mp3", "Hoa started the project in May and finished it in June.": "audio/cau/92423d5fe3d5c777.mp3", "Use the past simple for finished events.": "audio/cau/15e768d53722862d.mp3", "We finished our visual story yesterday.": "audio/cau/da44bbf9abdec66f.mp3", "Firstly, Lan makes a to-do list every evening.": "audio/cau/d1bb0725d0ded095.mp3", "Firstly, we should plan our work ahead.": "audio/cau/41a731569d9018b1.mp3", "Cycling keeps the body fit.": "audio/cau/afdb7ccf9257c0e5.mp3", "Hung plays badminton to keep fit.": "audio/cau/3fe2ba8717294893.mp3", "Swimming is good for your fitness.": "audio/cau/7a7b3547ba3828e9.mp3", "My mum goes to a fitness centre.": "audio/cau/e82f0eb023a51984.mp3", "The flood destroyed many houses.": "audio/cau/4b9cfb6d2745cf10.mp3", "After the flood, the streets were still flooded.": "audio/cau/429db91e2d9cf17e.mp3", "Many streets are flooded after the storm.": "audio/cau/e0f27e087e586d64.mp3", "Floods often happen here, and the roads get flooded.": "audio/cau/23af4d5fd03a0138.mp3", "Floods cause many problems in big cities.": "audio/cau/d40f32314c1ef999.mp3", "Last year's flood was worse than other floods.": "audio/cau/87421ba8b5e43d24.mp3", "The island has unique flora.": "audio/cau/2e77145d46a810a2.mp3", "We study the flora of the national park.": "audio/cau/cce66e7d7b3b5060.mp3", "Lan gives her friend a beautiful flower.": "audio/cau/fa4bac5dc4a6c0ef.mp3", "There are many flowers in my grandma's garden.": "audio/cau/a14860aa91d79b28.mp3", "How about putting some flowers on the table?": "audio/cau/2b9b6c204f34cab8.mp3", "My grandma grows flowers in her garden.": "audio/cau/8e0ebaa5f0e0c564.mp3", "Focus on the main events in his life.": "audio/cau/568e05bcb3ccde4d.mp3", "It's noisy, so Mi can't concentrate or focus on homework.": "audio/cau/e984cbce9e79c312.mp3", "We need food and water every day.": "audio/cau/01b6dc39aa643a2b.mp3", "Mum feeds the baby healthy food.": "audio/cau/1407b84140607171.mp3", "English is a foreign language.": "audio/cau/75e39b56b2c2c1a2.mp3", "Many foreign tourists visit Hoi An.": "audio/cau/f8d1768be4c80e9e.mp3", "Many animals live in the forest.": "audio/cau/de5591cef1bfa727.mp3", "We went camping in the forest.": "audio/cau/81f5245d16792b64.mp3", "We must protect our forests.": "audio/cau/1e9f9663fa7f3653.mp3", "Forests give us fresh air.": "audio/cau/4b28416cc0a06737.mp3", "After a good sleep, Lan is fully alert in class.": "audio/cau/e731cef6fdf5dd54.mp3", "Minh hasn't fully recovered from his cold.": "audio/cau/8cd54850c26f30ee.mp3", "This pottery is famous for its beauty and function.": "audio/cau/a33ab584acddf7ab.mp3", "The function of a fan is to keep us cool.": "audio/cau/96dc01cd4388f6b6.mp3", "The furniture is simple and functional.": "audio/cau/9173c8ff868058b6.mp3", "This old phone is still functional.": "audio/cau/32fd90684cde7fa7.mp3", "The word 'garden' starts with the letter G.": "audio/cau/855344adad6266b6.mp3", "Please write a capital G on the board.": "audio/cau/090b2d929a80461a.mp3", "I get up at six o'clock every day.": "audio/cau/0449db3f3777d108.mp3", "Mi got a letter from her pen friend yesterday.": "audio/cau/84f62d6a67e5f9cb.mp3", "Global warming is a big problem.": "audio/cau/2517ec4c2b354740.mp3", "English is a global language.": "audio/cau/ff5af81d904b15f7.mp3", "My goal is to cycle five kilometres a day.": "audio/cau/e3304ad7b4c8f035.mp3", "Lan set a goal of reading one book a month.": "audio/cau/ee4448e244e28ea6.mp3", "Nam is good at maths.": "audio/cau/4fd3587c745c05a2.mp3", "Lan's English is good, but Mi's is better.": "audio/cau/d371c25a8502dc92.mp3", "I got stuck in a traffic jam and came home late.": "audio/cau/fffb27ec64b971e2.mp3", "Mi usually gets up at six, but today she got up at seven.": "audio/cau/787111ee3d018017.mp3", "My grandfather is 75 years old.": "audio/cau/aaac8af2aea80407.mp3", "My grandfather and grandmother live in Hue.": "audio/cau/a198eed6e615b9c6.mp3", "Don't walk on the grass.": "audio/cau/9c3c7d0e34eef719.mp3", "Cows eat grass.": "audio/cau/10c328a8f63fe6bd.mp3", "Horses run on the grassland.": "audio/cau/86ed113208c1b60e.mp3", "Mongolia has large grassland.": "audio/cau/d3b2e65f77e11024.mp3", "That's a great idea for our project!": "audio/cau/a54aafc7aa505f92.mp3", "We had a great time; the trip was wonderful.": "audio/cau/3dc3e9c44a5960ce.mp3", "Your help is greatly appreciated.": "audio/cau/3e7c4dbae7d688f3.mp3", "Technology has greatly changed our lives.": "audio/cau/718fe374663a2930.mp3", "We need more green spaces in the city.": "audio/cau/7e358d9d053e2d45.mp3", "Our city is green, and it is getting greener.": "audio/cau/a9cfdf8c1935609c.mp3", "The city needs more greenery.": "audio/cau/28806f8937a6b84d.mp3", "I love the greenery of the countryside.": "audio/cau/b063a42fdc893563.mp3", "Each group has four members.": "audio/cau/6db9bb96270db26c.mp3", "Work in groups and report your group's findings.": "audio/cau/dd390edb36c261a2.mp3", "The guard stands at the school gate.": "audio/cau/0aee392cb562c33d.mp3", "Dogs can guard the house.": "audio/cau/c4afc71d13e13060.mp3", "The forest is the habitat of many birds.": "audio/cau/edf933ccace12f76.mp3", "Pollution destroys animals' habitats.": "audio/cau/7ead0876d6149ecb.mp3", "Animals are losing their habitats.": "audio/cau/b076e5fccde34e18.mp3", "Coral reefs are important habitats.": "audio/cau/509394b715cd2774.mp3", "We had a great time at the camp.": "audio/cau/9119cf6bce83ae88.mp3", "I have breakfast at six, but yesterday I had it late.": "audio/cau/8a0bd1bf7d672961.mp3", "Match the first half of the sentence with the second half.": "audio/cau/e212255b0f113a50.mp3", "Hoa ate half of the cake.": "audio/cau/6acf1dcf69afd1e6.mp3", "Please halve the apple for your brother.": "audio/cau/e2de28a4cdcd3ea0.mp3", "We should halve the time we spend on games.": "audio/cau/157eba4e9451aae5.mp3", "Raise your hand if you know the answer.": "audio/cau/70fad8908990bbee.mp3", "My grandma makes paper fans by hand.": "audio/cau/a8edd4bbd084c63c.mp3", "A conical hat is a famous handicraft of Hue.": "audio/cau/849e973e8c7917d5.mp3", "Pottery is a handicraft that people make by hand.": "audio/cau/dafd8b8197d1c2a9.mp3", "My grandma gave me a handmade scarf.": "audio/cau/c6d4f83ec20b3c4c.mp3", "Bat Trang is famous for handmade pottery.": "audio/cau/6a729478c560c0d3.mp3", "Smoking does harm to your health.": "audio/cau/d90fd389ad2dca29.mp3", "Plastic bags can harm sea animals.": "audio/cau/ecea23c7d3aed1e8.mp3", "Junk food is harmful to children.": "audio/cau/d6da923cea9a3662.mp3", "Too much screen time is harmful.": "audio/cau/4e98c12047f28c92.mp3", "Lan has two brothers.": "audio/cau/3ee04272e80b66c1.mp3", "Nam has a new bike; he had an old one before.": "audio/cau/756f69898700b7f4.mp3", "I have a cat and a dog.": "audio/cau/3942c510ddf250d4.mp3", "We have English today, and we had Maths yesterday.": "audio/cau/f53b658e1d0dc09e.mp3", "We are having lunch in the canteen.": "audio/cau/68be2432f9d1c150.mp3", "Lan is having fun because she has many friends here.": "audio/cau/955a8fc5bad8bd17.mp3", "Fresh air is good for your health.": "audio/cau/4e56d220f37f4d46.mp3", "Eat healthy food to keep good health.": "audio/cau/229acac5b67f1724.mp3", "Life in the countryside is healthier.": "audio/cau/75e5ce0c7e5245b8.mp3", "Fruit is healthy, and it is healthier than sweets.": "audio/cau/07d932ed0f8d8e57.mp3", "Minh eats healthily and goes to bed early.": "audio/cau/767c8f27243696ad.mp3", "To live healthily, Lan does exercise every morning.": "audio/cau/c444def93ae1a281.mp3", "Eating vegetables helps you stay healthy.": "audio/cau/db56d82300b94fea.mp3", "Good health is important, so eat healthy food.": "audio/cau/e0e29e3d98c8d03d.mp3", "My height is one metre fifty.": "audio/cau/6ed0620c69bbaf2a.mp3", "The tower is very high; its height is 100 metres.": "audio/cau/3baba19856abae04.mp3", "The campaign heightens awareness of pollution.": "audio/cau/56be7ae049bd5030.mp3", "Music can heighten your mood.": "audio/cau/6b33e5d565f0fa6e.mp3", "The map is very helpful for tourists.": "audio/cau/01dfa6b6d0d2dc96.mp3", "Mi is helpful; she often helps her neighbours.": "audio/cau/28366edc55c3b71c.mp3", "The sky train runs high above the ground.": "audio/cau/8dbedccf6d7409b7.mp3", "Birds fly high in the sky.": "audio/cau/b0c96ceb3c271f43.mp3", "This book is highly interesting.": "audio/cau/009ba70280cc0bc3.mp3", "I highly recommend this film.": "audio/cau/da2440ac003a9db6.mp3", "Please hold my bag for a moment.": "audio/cau/c556d9592e549b94.mp3", "Our school holds a sports day every year.": "audio/cau/290d899c332b44e8.mp3", "Nam does his homework at home every evening.": "audio/cau/0c529025b7e7c4aa.mp3", "I do my homework for an hour every evening.": "audio/cau/ada27edeb21f8fa6.mp3", "The bus comes hourly, so we wait an hour.": "audio/cau/3f37385bc8e75b24.mp3", "The bus leaves hourly.": "audio/cau/b60d74f653d3238e.mp3", "There is an hourly news update.": "audio/cau/f0d01c74c30ee817.mp3", "Our house is near the river.": "audio/cau/462620c6e9d42610.mp3", "Lan's house is big, so the housework takes a long time.": "audio/cau/ffae3b516fc16794.mp3", "Lan helps her mother with the housework.": "audio/cau/603758dd29202743.mp3", "I do housework at weekends, like cleaning the house.": "audio/cau/603861c40de6e77e.mp3", "He was poor. However, he never gave up.": "audio/cau/893555bad2aff789.mp3", "It rained. However, Nam still went to school, but late.": "audio/cau/97115d20f691f7e4.mp3", "Humans need clean air to live.": "audio/cau/67a9e9c7f01587d9.mp3", "Dogs are good friends of humans.": "audio/cau/b65c07750384a494.mp3", "Lions hunt zebras.": "audio/cau/e979d5c6712e318e.mp3", "People should not hunt rare animals.": "audio/cau/080e073df34bf4c3.mp3", "Hunting is banned in national parks.": "audio/cau/42ebecd645773fc6.mp3", "Hunting makes some animals disappear.": "audio/cau/dd45a1243f2e6f35.mp3", "The roads are icy in winter.": "audio/cau/0ea1d08b999f6659.mp3", "An icy wind blew from the north.": "audio/cau/37ab9e9f61657dcc.mp3", "There is an imbalance between work and play.": "audio/cau/72e945c0067fdb7e.mp3", "Eating too much sugar causes an imbalance in diet.": "audio/cau/c311351dfb806a9d.mp3", "We talked about the importance of local crafts.": "audio/cau/1dd1fbbbd5db7ba1.mp3", "Sleep is important; we all know its importance.": "audio/cau/39fdef6a24182eb1.mp3", "It is important to keep our streets clean.": "audio/cau/4541b30fbeb1b8aa.mp3", "Reading is important; never forget its importance.": "audio/cau/0b2b91b8a69bb8c9.mp3", "More importantly, we must save water.": "audio/cau/09a367b8deac295f.mp3", "Most importantly, be kind to others.": "audio/cau/8709c00d7d3b3af1.mp3", "Watching TV all day makes you inactive.": "audio/cau/41590c23ceb7a257.mp3", "The volcano has been inactive for years.": "audio/cau/6cfc968444b1c2e9.mp3", "Your homework is incomplete.": "audio/cau/1def1df8007e7413.mp3", "Complete the incomplete sentences.": "audio/cau/865265a2ff56d7b1.mp3", "Correct the incorrect sentences.": "audio/cau/0fa204f88cc856c0.mp3", "Your answer is incorrect, so please correct it.": "audio/cau/2d6a22f249708653.mp3", "He spelled my name incorrectly.": "audio/cau/6f22f1fabc9ff68f.mp3", "If you answer incorrectly, try again.": "audio/cau/8a143b786c81fbef.mp3", "Pollution increases in big cities.": "audio/cau/0ced1e4a98403210.mp3", "Reading increases your vocabulary.": "audio/cau/90ae5e2bd1e994f2.mp3", "After 'How about', we use the verb with -ing.": "audio/cau/0b5b2f5d668491cd.mp3", "How about buying a new lamp for your bedroom?": "audio/cau/55a020c7bbf1ac54.mp3", "My school is big and beautiful.": "audio/cau/d5765e25cafa0eea.mp3", "Today it is sunny, but yesterday it was rainy.": "audio/cau/ed1bcaf6501bfd0c.mp3", "The word 'kitchen' starts with the letter k.": "audio/cau/ac85fdd0f3c32f82.mp3", "Please write a capital K on the board.": "audio/cau/f5d61da2bd65aeef.mp3", "We should keep our streets clean.": "audio/cau/3f2dd8440f55f148.mp3", "Lan kept her old toys, and she still keeps them.": "audio/cau/d20c525ce8b90756.mp3", "The zoo keeper feeds the animals.": "audio/cau/06704e78accc1c51.mp3", "Our keeper saved the ball.": "audio/cau/af8db4e0f0173737.mp3", "Uncle Ho is known and loved by all Vietnamese people.": "audio/cau/e714527fbec233eb.mp3", "Many people know him; he is well known in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/ea446edd847c7b43.mp3", "The word 'lamp' starts with the letter l.": "audio/cau/c5e08a5413a4f66b.mp3", "Please write a capital L on the board.": "audio/cau/63173cda63a08912.mp3", "Hoan Kiem Lake is in the centre of Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/98e7edb5d4146709.mp3", "We walk around the lake every morning.": "audio/cau/f01b3e2f8bffaa21.mp3", "The farmers work on the land.": "audio/cau/6d0e3761e23077c3.mp3", "The plane will land at 9 a.m.": "audio/cau/d05f0dd262880be5.mp3", "I visited my grandparents last weekend.": "audio/cau/553e8bea75bbdbbd.mp3", "Last Sunday was fun, and next Sunday will be fun too.": "audio/cau/17be93822cc3c397.mp3", "Lastly, turn off the lights.": "audio/cau/317a43523f160ba8.mp3", "Lastly, I want to thank my teachers.": "audio/cau/ed0db063c09f784e.mp3", "Don't be lazy; do your homework.": "audio/cau/e8cd1ea0644d6fc1.mp3", "My cat is lazy and sleeps all day.": "audio/cau/fc1756a55ab83842.mp3", "We learn English at school.": "audio/cau/9bc26f3d76057248.mp3", "Nam wants to learn to swim, and his sister learnt last year.": "audio/cau/5a7392296080d626.mp3", "She is a fast learner.": "audio/cau/bdda689dc68ad8a3.mp3", "This book is for English learners.": "audio/cau/5aa493db6a382d2e.mp3", "I learnt a new song today.": "audio/cau/002dc8ba978f437b.mp3", "Mi likes to learn new words; yesterday she learnt ten.": "audio/cau/01afc6c13b541caf.mp3", "Students need to sleep at least eight hours a day.": "audio/cau/06d7a5fd2aadd1a8.mp3", "Nam has less homework than Mi, and Lan has the least.": "audio/cau/144df5d8b5b5a253.mp3", "Could you lend me your pen, please?": "audio/cau/40209fe783cf272d.mp3", "Nam lent me a book, and I'll borrow another tomorrow.": "audio/cau/589c3a2aa17ce3c9.mp3", "The bank is a money lender.": "audio/cau/5810dca44605198b.mp3", "Be a good lender and a good borrower.": "audio/cau/3873e1fa90cf2943.mp3", "Village life is less noisy than city life.": "audio/cau/00a225b39b028bcc.mp3", "I have little time, less than Mi; Nam has the least.": "audio/cau/310826397361a2bd.mp3", "The noise level in the city is high.": "audio/cau/a26c6097f6ef8f1d.mp3", "I passed level 3 of the game.": "audio/cau/0036261d63187898.mp3", "He had a difficult life when he was young.": "audio/cau/0e2c7b87c896e8b7.mp3", "City life is busy, and people live very fast.": "audio/cau/c7a56b97906b19d2.mp3", "Please listen to Lan's life story carefully.": "audio/cau/5e66ffcca03d62ba.mp3", "Minh is a good listener; he always listens to his friends.": "audio/cau/2a4b1d64993cd32a.mp3", "My mum is a good listener.": "audio/cau/c361fe2d103db23c.mp3", "The radio programme has many listeners.": "audio/cau/95723f87c574336f.mp3", "Thank you for listening.": "audio/cau/ee26d140bc752b99.mp3", "Nam is listening to music; he loves to listen to pop songs.": "audio/cau/8451afe66a0bd788.mp3", "We live in a small village.": "audio/cau/8438d091662da029.mp3", "My grandparents live in the countryside and have a happy life.": "audio/cau/a21ec63c6b42bc8d.mp3", "The liveliness of the market surprised the tourists.": "audio/cau/1f8d1f8c4032f05b.mp3", "I love the liveliness of Tet holiday.": "audio/cau/052386f3749c3787.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is very lively at night.": "audio/cau/f7f9de50246fc30a.mp3", "The market is lively and busy in the morning.": "audio/cau/be87297ba2d5a7fc.mp3", "There is a big sofa in the living room.": "audio/cau/85ee341c5ccef3a3.mp3", "We live in a small house with a nice living room.": "audio/cau/a4537e161135cc8a.mp3", "Bat Trang pottery is a famous local product.": "audio/cau/ea08f150b9375ac4.mp3", "Many locals buy food from local farmers at the market.": "audio/cau/dfc3f008f3837ff1.mp3", "We buy vegetables grown locally.": "audio/cau/a3e3351624cf6115.mp3", "This cake is made locally in Hue.": "audio/cau/9156314b93fdb87f.mp3", "Some villages may lose their traditional crafts.": "audio/cau/bce588b5a80d185a.mp3", "Don't lose your key; I lost mine last week.": "audio/cau/828561b9bfd1a13e.mp3", "The loser shook hands with the winner.": "audio/cau/1be1845c7ef5dd94.mp3", "Don't be a bad loser.": "audio/cau/0dd12f964b5c6872.mp3", "With a plan, Lan is never at a loss with too much work.": "audio/cau/bb851d51c8b95d7d.mp3", "Nam was at a loss when all his tests came at once.": "audio/cau/8f5192fc719bd367.mp3", "I lost my pen yesterday.": "audio/cau/23e62d5295ebade9.mp3", "We got lost in the old town.": "audio/cau/78a43d0df814944e.mp3", "The price of this book is low.": "audio/cau/0a550bb977c74722.mp3", "The wall is very low.": "audio/cau/e9866ca6574d7e65.mp3", "I'm a student at Nguyen Du High School.": "audio/cau/fc4e40becc452649.mp3", "I'm happy because I am with my best friends.": "audio/cau/70dc61c954d001ef.mp3", "He made his first computer in a small garage.": "audio/cau/ab57132318aeca10.mp3", "This vase is made of clay; people make it in Bat Trang.": "audio/cau/e23523961a9ed154.mp3", "People here mainly grow rice.": "audio/cau/39ba45d7f9277780.mp3", "I mainly use my phone for study.": "audio/cau/7e14d886ebe6707d.mp3", "Hard work can make your dreams come true.": "audio/cau/b31d6220b696ab85.mp3", "He made many mistakes, but he learnt to make good choices.": "audio/cau/f95abe45aba09ae8.mp3", "He is a famous film maker.": "audio/cau/68e4b5c408bfa483.mp3", "My uncle is a furniture maker.": "audio/cau/177cfe96f7f1bf13.mp3", "He is my best mate.": "audio/cau/0c79fb38782a501a.mp3", "I play football with my mates.": "audio/cau/d284658870b27dd3.mp3", "This is a good method to learn words.": "audio/cau/3c706623138a9ce2.mp3", "Our teacher uses a new method.": "audio/cau/63fd83da91e3b54f.mp3", "There are many methods to save water.": "audio/cau/226f23561a4955df.mp3", "Farmers use modern methods now.": "audio/cau/14bebb2c5f9bc541.mp3", "Mai sits in the middle of the first row.": "audio/cau/fb9af6047d7545a8.mp3", "There is a table in the middle, or centre, of the room.": "audio/cau/d1fcde7c79b36590.mp3", "The moon is very bright tonight.": "audio/cau/02e56f03f332b839.mp3", "Children look at the moon at Mid-Autumn.": "audio/cau/fd329d437dfe6d36.mp3", "Moonquakes are weaker than earthquakes.": "audio/cau/b80f31a2a99a5bae.mp3", "Astronauts studied moonquakes.": "audio/cau/f8c6e479a602e415.mp3", "The people in my neighbourhood are mostly friendly.": "audio/cau/54584631f0893d3f.mp3", "We mostly travel by bus because it is cheap.": "audio/cau/05f1e9640ad3b61c.mp3", "My mother is a nurse.": "audio/cau/7504a7ce3f463355.mp3", "Mi's mother, her mum, cooks very well.": "audio/cau/4860342249a4a0b1.mp3", "Motherhood is a wonderful job.": "audio/cau/a41df636f68c1eb3.mp3", "She enjoys motherhood very much.": "audio/cau/aae8c60a567bd35c.mp3", "My mum works in a hospital.": "audio/cau/6797efc1f7e404e7.mp3", "I love my mum; she is a kind mother.": "audio/cau/9c8b3cd7b9c8ebfc.mp3", "In 'running', we double the letter n.": "audio/cau/f2d3227ba2e63feb.mp3", "Run ends in n, so we write running with two n's.": "audio/cau/840a0ecac7ac2b05.mp3", "The streets in the Old Quarter are narrow.": "audio/cau/9058634a261c5e8d.mp3", "This road is narrow, but that one is wide.": "audio/cau/79669b37f4a1ddbc.mp3", "This street is narrower than mine.": "audio/cau/9310ed466849503d.mp3", "The river gets narrower here.": "audio/cau/fb37c03c3e13abb0.mp3", "Our team narrowly won the match.": "audio/cau/c1801a7dcf731a27.mp3", "He narrowly missed the bus.": "audio/cau/d7525e854554ccc9.mp3", "Viet Nam is a nation of 54 ethnic groups.": "audio/cau/fc0377b6b344369a.mp3", "The whole nation celebrates Tet.": "audio/cau/bde6381a94c2d89f.mp3", "She won a national prize in maths.": "audio/cau/6a93b9368e7abe3a.mp3", "Our nation has many national heroes.": "audio/cau/fe097f04f907a2a9.mp3", "What's your nationality? – I'm Vietnamese.": "audio/cau/b014a2963ce2a0a6.mp3", "Students of many nationalities study here.": "audio/cau/69961830c1359fbc.mp3", "The show is broadcast nationally.": "audio/cau/2cb4d46f15de799c.mp3", "She is known nationally as a singer.": "audio/cau/7730eae5a497ae0d.mp3", "Ha Long Bay is a natural wonder.": "audio/cau/090f3246ac97d064.mp3", "We should use natural light.": "audio/cau/6a5bbb9647fc89e3.mp3", "We should protect nature.": "audio/cau/43fd6f1ae36eca76.mp3", "I love the beauty of nature.": "audio/cau/0044999cd3572ec0.mp3", "There is a big park nearby.": "audio/cau/0bbea8d853e59092.mp3", "My school is near my house, and a market is nearby too.": "audio/cau/b046b21263949e43.mp3", "It's nearly six o'clock, so let's go home.": "audio/cau/245ae82d42650c9f.mp3", "Nam nearly missed the bus; he was almost late.": "audio/cau/b606a8d1edcf35c6.mp3", "Expensive things are not necessarily good.": "audio/cau/b04fec88e4c036f0.mp3", "You don't necessarily need a car.": "audio/cau/18e17e9bef38dea0.mp3", "Is it necessary to wear a helmet?": "audio/cau/310488fddb9b7077.mp3", "Water is necessary for life; it is a basic necessity.": "audio/cau/1c5a7a36e7e8db29.mp3", "Sleep is a necessity for teenagers.": "audio/cau/27a394cb3b9c7cbc.mp3", "Food is a necessity, so it is necessary to eat well.": "audio/cau/aa863ba3b198593c.mp3", "If I have all the needed ingredients, I can make a delicious pizza.": "audio/cau/b8863fe0f2752a65.mp3", "Hoa brings all the needed books to class.": "audio/cau/8b00a387319795d2.mp3", "Nam feels nervous before exams.": "audio/cau/dd8456cf6721dfe8.mp3", "Don't be nervous. You can do it!": "audio/cau/a44a3cfdc9f742bc.mp3", "She waited nervously for her result.": "audio/cau/ce45a7fbe71be95b.mp3", "He smiled nervously at the teacher.": "audio/cau/4797a18267300643.mp3", "Deep breaths can reduce nervousness.": "audio/cau/f9e8d93d5eb1d119.mp3", "I felt nervousness before the exam.": "audio/cau/baf0a5adfeaf469a.mp3", "The fishermen pull the net from the sea.": "audio/cau/e8494b12f73ac665.mp3", "I search for information on the Net.": "audio/cau/53b22ace4b209995.mp3", "She never gave up her dream.": "audio/cau/b95a5dea82e7f24d.mp3", "Never give up; always try your best.": "audio/cau/45044467beb1d1bf.mp3", "It was raining. Nevertheless, we went out.": "audio/cau/96e041b73011f4c0.mp3", "The test was hard. Nevertheless, I passed.": "audio/cau/f2dd49917bd958c6.mp3", "See you next week!": "audio/cau/e955abbc627cb84b.mp3", "Last week we had a test, and next week we have a trip.": "audio/cau/e51bba1694cc9fe2.mp3", "The city is noisy at night.": "audio/cau/003950b6dbcd9d77.mp3", "We went out last night, so tonight we stay at home.": "audio/cau/334224d67553dca2.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City has an exciting nightlife.": "audio/cau/db63b206001cd606.mp3", "The nightlife here is lively, and the streets are busy at night.": "audio/cau/3d60979904eca10a.mp3", "Our street is noisy because of the traffic.": "audio/cau/c625fc467757080e.mp3", "The city is noisy, but my village is quiet.": "audio/cau/63c66e344ab53850.mp3", "Ha Noi is in the north of Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/5af5919b198f2d46.mp3", "The wind comes from the north.": "audio/cau/d039649b93012564.mp3", "She did not give up her dream.": "audio/cau/b5d39e3052bc5fbb.mp3", "I am not tired, and I'm not hungry.": "audio/cau/9485504d93b05a38.mp3", "The Pacific Ocean is the biggest ocean.": "audio/cau/3173e229089548be.mp3", "Plastic waste goes into the sea and then the ocean.": "audio/cau/7d40b32c72996455.mp3", "Turn off the lights when you leave.": "audio/cau/3a68f3ab6e248006.mp3", "Turn on the fan, but turn off the TV.": "audio/cau/bdd957c99adde5f0.mp3", "I often get up at six o'clock.": "audio/cau/08008a46175a2d25.mp3", "Minh often reads books, but he never plays games.": "audio/cau/a29cadde346ad9ba.mp3", "Our school organised a book fair.": "audio/cau/b8e5335267df2055.mp3", "She is a very organised student.": "audio/cau/78dd6fbd6335576d.mp3", "Get enough sleep every night; otherwise, your health will suffer.": "audio/cau/88349a162c32012c.mp3", "Wear a coat; otherwise, you might catch a cold.": "audio/cau/58a979e859eb4708.mp3", "Mi went out with her friends last night.": "audio/cau/6662db3eac9ce4e0.mp3", "Nam wants to find out more about his grandfather's life.": "audio/cau/c2c4b3120ecb6468.mp3", "The city has many outdoor markets.": "audio/cau/70f031e665dcb6a3.mp3", "Phong likes outdoor sports, so he often plays outdoors.": "audio/cau/62d7cb3e1f835b37.mp3", "The ox pulls the cart.": "audio/cau/6e832ac18111ab9c.mp3", "Farmers used oxen to plough fields.": "audio/cau/25cc8fcaa9fe02f4.mp3", "Trees give us oxygen.": "audio/cau/2bd40904960aaa48.mp3", "There is no oxygen on the Moon.": "audio/cau/c0602a9f0ae0546a.mp3", "The film starts at 8 p.m.": "audio/cau/5b3d11f7cb5bec98.mp3", "School finishes at 4.30 p.m., and I have dinner at 7 p.m.": "audio/cau/6193e0ae396e4d78.mp3", "My dad paid for the tickets.": "audio/cau/b4014cbad8c7d1da.mp3", "I paid 20,000 dong for the book.": "audio/cau/5359db2d26ba3bf6.mp3", "This is the Panda Room.": "audio/cau/6da2c54e49159886.mp3", "The panda is eating bamboo.": "audio/cau/c7f10d77305d79dd.mp3", "This part of the lesson is about friends.": "audio/cau/fe137d473624dc0c.mp3", "We take part in the game, and it is partly about music.": "audio/cau/f86fd833e90206a2.mp3", "It will be partly cloudy tomorrow.": "audio/cau/2e9279ced890cd59.mp3", "The story is partly true.": "audio/cau/a56a321d8dcb3386.mp3", "The lesson has three parts.": "audio/cau/1b1d9c097e2f0ab4.mp3", "Name the parts of the face: eyes, nose and mouth.": "audio/cau/1959d4fcb37c5b1b.mp3", "How much do you pay for a bowl of pho?": "audio/cau/e807ddb92a3f24db.mp3", "Mum paid for the books yesterday.": "audio/cau/15922b0414be0bc7.mp3", "You can make a payment by phone.": "audio/cau/364d4d9ceff8c0e1.mp3", "Cash payment is still popular.": "audio/cau/3becbcc878ec652a.mp3", "The village is quiet and peaceful, not noisy like the city.": "audio/cau/c7f81daa39689185.mp3", "I use my phone to call my grandparents.": "audio/cau/8e9996c8fa495f09.mp3", "Lan phoned me last night on her new phone.": "audio/cau/8ac9d116e44bf63f.mp3", "Can you take a photo of us?": "audio/cau/4e7337681afc841a.mp3", "This photo is a nice picture of my class.": "audio/cau/94f608c9dc656d2b.mp3", "This is a photograph of my family.": "audio/cau/be34afde07857706.mp3", "She took a photograph of the sea.": "audio/cau/0deaad3e91e725aa.mp3", "My uncle is a photographer.": "audio/cau/84945e0c05f98e38.mp3", "The photographer took many pictures.": "audio/cau/78c35f6d244bab0b.mp3", "Photography is my hobby.": "audio/cau/88fd201b0df30c9f.mp3", "She joined a photography club.": "audio/cau/2a930abea3fb3545.mp3", "'Look after' is a phrasal verb.": "audio/cau/af602eb955e2891a.mp3", "Learn each phrase and use the phrasal verbs in sentences.": "audio/cau/40a96f6869b52557.mp3", "Match each phrase with its meaning.": "audio/cau/557dd9e0b36c6f5f.mp3", "'Go out' is a phrasal verb, and 'in the city' is a phrase.": "audio/cau/ca722714e28c9b92.mp3", "Use these phrases in your presentation.": "audio/cau/4f40d1db291eb325.mp3", "Write one phrase from the box, then add two more phrases.": "audio/cau/f53433a3dd4c0563.mp3", "Pick a card, please.": "audio/cau/1e4e9d51e347aede.mp3", "We pick tea leaves in the morning.": "audio/cau/c487a2bfd0d8d890.mp3", "My uncle picked us up at the bus station.": "audio/cau/b0c8e2d47baf7115.mp3", "Lan picked some flowers in the garden.": "audio/cau/ce45c98795b6b9e7.mp3", "Look at the picture and describe the man.": "audio/cau/b1d73989f1f7619c.mp3", "Hoa draws a picture, and Nam takes a photo of it.": "audio/cau/40c2b9c3207a7713.mp3", "This is a nice place to live.": "audio/cau/160e9180eaed0aee.mp3", "Let's meet at the usual place after school.": "audio/cau/f760c0b8e65d51b8.mp3", "There are many interesting places in my town.": "audio/cau/22530fda716b27a9.mp3", "The market is my favourite place in town.": "audio/cau/6904ef4273568097.mp3", "Earth is our planet.": "audio/cau/6f7b3ecf5f2930a7.mp3", "Mars is a red planet.": "audio/cau/0de5bbb6c6f0ac63.mp3", "There is a plant next to the window.": "audio/cau/ead07f80a6f49805.mp3", "Mi plants flowers and waters the plants every day.": "audio/cau/8379ade47936222a.mp3", "Plants need water and sunlight.": "audio/cau/e6bc337addd58412.mp3", "People make com from young rice plants.": "audio/cau/5ab8c23c4ad5e1eb.mp3", "It is very cold at the North Pole.": "audio/cau/55c1f8cbfb3ddf32.mp3", "The flag is on a tall pole.": "audio/cau/eb82a3d3eae0dd7a.mp3", "The Earth has two poles.": "audio/cau/0736a1421f09407d.mp3", "They put up the tent with two poles.": "audio/cau/70dedd29cbf34003.mp3", "Factories pollute the river.": "audio/cau/2157f7ac9f788df5.mp3", "Don't pollute the beach.": "audio/cau/13ed1940cd163a96.mp3", "The air in big cities is often polluted.": "audio/cau/3f2265c1134300cf.mp3", "Traffic causes air pollution, so the city is polluted.": "audio/cau/41cbf08c31632fed.mp3", "Cars are polluting the air.": "audio/cau/872569f2417d5f9d.mp3", "Stop polluting our lakes!": "audio/cau/0fabf9c64e71756c.mp3", "Noise pollution is a big problem in the city.": "audio/cau/6f7de550e9658c27.mp3", "Factories pollute the river, so the water is polluted.": "audio/cau/b4e816708b260a17.mp3", "There was no power last night.": "audio/cau/fe5e67d8a829a03f.mp3", "Solar power is clean energy.": "audio/cau/3e87c6627b274c1d.mp3", "The preservation of old houses is important.": "audio/cau/3ace5ba98b1721b1.mp3", "We support wildlife preservation.": "audio/cau/ba7ebbe40df6804b.mp3", "We must preserve our traditional crafts.": "audio/cau/4151c066363a5208.mp3", "The village works hard to protect and preserve its old houses.": "audio/cau/2efd6ae0e9834fdb.mp3", "Students feel pressure before exams.": "audio/cau/88d21fbe736abb86.mp3", "Peer pressure can be strong.": "audio/cau/74049743d4aec6fa.mp3", "List the pros and cons of social media.": "audio/cau/ae581c418749d8c5.mp3", "He plays tennis like a pro.": "audio/cau/7397b8cc352e34cd.mp3", "This factory produces bikes.": "audio/cau/b5f2a121fb4a3beb.mp3", "The farm produces fresh vegetables.": "audio/cau/6a245e8c9139e500.mp3", "We should protect the environment.": "audio/cau/b90a58bb2e782cd1.mp3", "A helmet gives you protection on the road.": "audio/cau/20e1fdaea6d0589e.mp3", "Wear a hat for protection from the sun.": "audio/cau/12b42ac906e9da91.mp3", "Environmental protection is important.": "audio/cau/43e1448861a4441d.mp3", "Wear protective clothes in the lab.": "audio/cau/2bb33d7e58d7a7ee.mp3", "Parents are protective of their children.": "audio/cau/c55c927eb0326829.mp3", "The school provides free lunch.": "audio/cau/1f694f01addd8209.mp3", "Trees provide shade.": "audio/cau/c989999ea62ae048.mp3", "There are 40 pupils in my class.": "audio/cau/fa147b5c3216f8cc.mp3", "She is a good pupil.": "audio/cau/e17bb8917e55a7f5.mp3", "What is the purpose of this building?": "audio/cau/c0a9c9321aa3a396.mp3", "Our aim is to help people, and that is our purpose.": "audio/cau/5c1e912b871737c5.mp3", "She leads a purposeful life.": "audio/cau/61c62af9856410ea.mp3", "Make your study time purposeful.": "audio/cau/1af3fbcb31dc8433.mp3", "Quakes often happen in Japan.": "audio/cau/842ce3725f0aa99f.mp3", "The quakes damaged many houses.": "audio/cau/e7aeffb741d3b330.mp3", "The library is a quiet place.": "audio/cau/cf5d391e8e881e58.mp3", "My village is quieter and more peaceful than the city.": "audio/cau/fe9afae0f73f7b97.mp3", "The word 'red' starts with the letter r.": "audio/cau/19d12f34975f740f.mp3", "'Rabbit' and 'room' both begin with R.": "audio/cau/aca28cd4f322eeb4.mp3", "It's a rainy day today.": "audio/cau/7487252f9ed5b9ee.mp3", "The rainy season starts in May.": "audio/cau/041cbb54abf51c95.mp3", "This bird is very rare.": "audio/cau/48fafe88c8e922d6.mp3", "Snow is rare in Ho Chi Minh City.": "audio/cau/10cf42b4395f3004.mp3", "I rarely go to the cinema.": "audio/cau/665f28d3968d7eec.mp3", "Snow is rare in Ha Noi, so we rarely see it.": "audio/cau/651a9aa109c5d5ab.mp3", "We're playing in the park now.": "audio/cau/ce568c1634d30075.mp3", "They're my friends, and they are very kind.": "audio/cau/aea78a52a03a937e.mp3", "The northern region is cold in winter.": "audio/cau/b254434977770d85.mp3", "This region is famous for tea.": "audio/cau/e8e4ca519e6d56fa.mp3", "Vietnam has three main regions.": "audio/cau/4302ee1efef800fc.mp3", "Some regions have no rain for months.": "audio/cau/cd2edcdb20657cf7.mp3", "I relax by reading books at weekends.": "audio/cau/7a14312dbb4ab728.mp3", "After school, I listen to music to relax.": "audio/cau/cb3ed8bfdce9e8f8.mp3", "Music is good for relaxation.": "audio/cau/00f61d33b157afba.mp3", "I read books for relaxation.": "audio/cau/6f32318faf672d5d.mp3", "Walking in the morning makes us feel relaxed.": "audio/cau/8a55a52b63802535.mp3", "Hoa feels relaxed after listening to music.": "audio/cau/a280c4ce5593c872.mp3", "Listen and repeat the words.": "audio/cau/a50278163c989459.mp3", "Please repeat it; repetition helps us remember.": "audio/cau/43cefd1dcd1c0767.mp3", "He repeatedly asked the same question.": "audio/cau/48d086a1c8bf03c4.mp3", "I practised the word repeatedly.": "audio/cau/8fcf2ad0962efb7f.mp3", "We ask for repetition when we can't hear someone.": "audio/cau/147624069647f8c5.mp3", "Repetition helps you remember new words.": "audio/cau/58b216cd92c4f23a.mp3", "She replied to my email.": "audio/cau/2fbd94e9b5184829.mp3", "'Yes,' he replied.": "audio/cau/1184cff77b7797c5.mp3", "How does Elena reply to her mum?": "audio/cau/dcaf59d7091175e8.mp3", "Please reply to my email soon.": "audio/cau/1fbb259adb0f0a8b.mp3", "Cuc Phuong is a nature reserve.": "audio/cau/252eaeb240c00c29.mp3", "I reserved a table for four.": "audio/cau/c2a35b371b2c0c2c.mp3", "Vietnam has many nature reserves.": "audio/cau/6824092eb7193af7.mp3", "Oil reserves will run out one day.": "audio/cau/4e77893a1645d993.mp3", "We must save natural resources.": "audio/cau/08c06c08ded8169e.mp3", "The school has many learning resources.": "audio/cau/fffc57810f4e590a.mp3", "Clap to the rhythm of the music.": "audio/cau/13f8d6afd69dd60f.mp3", "This song has a fast rhythm.": "audio/cau/13677d06d4d2cfe5.mp3", "He is a rich man.": "audio/cau/94ae2901b2b5cb7b.mp3", "Vietnam has a rich culture.": "audio/cau/549692b165e5c98f.mp3", "Your answer is right, Nam.": "audio/cau/de0207c9ebd60141.mp3", "Is this answer right or wrong?": "audio/cau/6f5632fc348cdcbc.mp3", "She rightly said no.": "audio/cau/0716d99ea752c0a9.mp3", "He was rightly proud of his work.": "audio/cau/82f83dc7701970f6.mp3", "My aunt's house is near the river.": "audio/cau/a6e8ddca094f143a.mp3", "We swim in the river in summer.": "audio/cau/ad856ac1e2451519.mp3", "We had a picnic by the riverside.": "audio/cau/7c9b83750b247a1b.mp3", "There is a riverside café.": "audio/cau/2fc65f9804bd39f5.mp3", "Be careful when you cross the road.": "audio/cau/7d44eca76d25a07d.mp3", "This road is busy in the morning.": "audio/cau/84aea104087d60d6.mp3", "She's my best friend in class 6A.": "audio/cau/810592fcf73e04e7.mp3", "This is Vinh's bike, and he's in my class.": "audio/cau/6a8b8131a5222edf.mp3", "Mi and I are in the same class.": "audio/cau/bc1a18955ee28275.mp3", "My bag is the same as yours, not different.": "audio/cau/b8e990694854227f.mp3", "I go to school by bike.": "audio/cau/df5dcef1ab40916f.mp3", "I put my books in my schoolbag before school.": "audio/cau/c492164eb59da7f4.mp3", "My schoolbag is too heavy today.": "audio/cau/8d0a65c64cf8ce99.mp3", "She puts her books in her schoolbag.": "audio/cau/3f97f32ee71ad86a.mp3", "My grandparents' house is near the sea.": "audio/cau/acd2af1fe0d48aed.mp3", "We swim in the sea in summer.": "audio/cau/a658c72373cebc53.mp3", "I seldom watch TV on school days.": "audio/cau/9eac1d68b1aaf03d.mp3", "My dad seldom gets angry with us.": "audio/cau/8296aefbed0f630f.mp3", "Select the correct answer A, B or C.": "audio/cau/fa11d36a6784e8b9.mp3", "She selected a red dress for the party.": "audio/cau/949a496976983bca.mp3", "Write a sentence about your family.": "audio/cau/9ffdb94eb27ae024.mp3", "This sentence is short and easy to read.": "audio/cau/f99b7a9b5f47ebe1.mp3", "Please write five sentences about your best friend.": "audio/cau/9fbb8a8d97d0001d.mp3", "The first sentence is easy, but the other sentences are hard.": "audio/cau/8cf810890ade1eda.mp3", "They are serving lunch in the canteen.": "audio/cau/0c6bf0400587c7cb.mp3", "Eat five servings of fruit a day.": "audio/cau/540700d4ebf69488.mp3", "There is a significant change in the weather.": "audio/cau/67863b502f69860b.mp3", "Mid-Autumn is a significant festival for children.": "audio/cau/74a1c5a832bdca70.mp3", "This green mango is very sour.": "audio/cau/74ec46a7251fd983.mp3", "We love sour soup with fish.": "audio/cau/436a0ef54ea92750.mp3", "Ca Mau is in the south of Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/335ef32087970e22.mp3", "Birds fly south in winter.": "audio/cau/a86decadd15ceb46.mp3", "Can you speak English well?": "audio/cau/7e70c8ed41dd5f73.mp3", "Mi spoke to her teacher after class.": "audio/cau/9631c4f9d08103cf.mp3", "She is a good English speaker.": "audio/cau/ad8983e10a3153eb.mp3", "Turn up the speaker, please.": "audio/cau/176c25890d4baf0b.mp3", "Our head teacher gave a short speech today.": "audio/cau/d7f9999a0661fac2.mp3", "Mi will speak first, then Nam will give his speech.": "audio/cau/e7405c38166acf2a.mp3", "She spoke English very well.": "audio/cau/021d27ba9b445e58.mp3", "I spoke to my teacher after class.": "audio/cau/8a7ed13ad52bfd30.mp3", "English is spoken in many countries.": "audio/cau/0ddaddfdf518ec9f.mp3", "Have you spoken to Nam yet?": "audio/cau/8c0ca43c0de90d55.mp3", "This is a good spot for a picnic.": "audio/cau/28c93ee0c5b412d2.mp3", "A ladybird has black spots.": "audio/cau/114961e94154c7be.mp3", "Our English lesson will start at eight.": "audio/cau/920ac7d03b952080.mp3", "We start at seven and finish at eleven.": "audio/cau/f8b0988a876acebc.mp3", "The train is stopping at Hue station.": "audio/cau/09e435098d70754f.mp3", "We kept talking without stopping.": "audio/cau/5a062d210d5ca29c.mp3", "There are many shops on this street.": "audio/cau/3f780db4db7c5418.mp3", "Lan loves street food in the Old Quarter.": "audio/cau/88f07584eb11353e.mp3", "The streets in Ha Noi are busy at rush hour.": "audio/cau/9d135f4e1e753d49.mp3", "This street is quiet, but the other streets are noisy.": "audio/cau/ef9a487276d660b4.mp3", "Exercise can help you reduce stress.": "audio/cau/22e33d982d8aa525.mp3", "Exams are stressful, so many students feel stressed.": "audio/cau/bf9649e515e0312c.mp3", "Trang feels stressed before her exams.": "audio/cau/391aaca629e80ddb.mp3", "City life is stressful, but I feel relaxed in the countryside.": "audio/cau/432e206709e6350f.mp3", "The week before the exams is very stressful.": "audio/cau/0d92b94536b66fb1.mp3", "Hoa listens to music after a stressful day.": "audio/cau/45aea1d5388baf99.mp3", "She worked stressfully before the exam.": "audio/cau/eb7b7cc3d4699d0c.mp3", "Don't live too stressfully, take a rest.": "audio/cau/35a0e8133816f62a.mp3", "The people in my village have strong ties.": "audio/cau/820ea51c66a51b95.mp3", "Phong is strong, but his little brother is weak.": "audio/cau/73e0a188067b76d4.mp3", "Mi is a student at Ba Dinh Secondary School.": "audio/cau/569937b828afcac4.mp3", "Every student must study hard for the test.": "audio/cau/88443b78f0da0120.mp3", "Mi studies English every evening.": "audio/cau/b1218f9b9530760b.mp3", "Nam studied hard last year, and now he studies even harder.": "audio/cau/9817881934cebf3a.mp3", "Lan is a studious girl.": "audio/cau/05497c979da2f836.mp3", "Studious students often get good marks.": "audio/cau/56f0c28f3e5463f3.mp3", "I study English every evening.": "audio/cau/2a98035816ae0fe1.mp3", "Hoa is a studious student; she likes to study maths.": "audio/cau/81fcae64bc4c3e71.mp3", "The sun rises early in summer.": "audio/cau/f4f11748f6c98beb.mp3", "It is sunny today, so we can play in the sun.": "audio/cau/257c0e37b623b01d.mp3", "Plants need sunlight to grow.": "audio/cau/f383a6ae0636753b.mp3", "Sunlight comes in through the window.": "audio/cau/0cf1d7a6c6e1e30b.mp3", "It is sunny today, so we go to the beach.": "audio/cau/bf69362fe8f7f110.mp3", "It was a sunny day, so Nam played football in the park.": "audio/cau/b55154d4fb0d6727.mp3", "Let's go out and enjoy the sunshine.": "audio/cau/2fcc24104cd414fc.mp3", "The flowers open in the morning sunshine.": "audio/cau/c7eb1e91b2633260.mp3", "Count the syllables in each word.": "audio/cau/bbece61a02febd54.mp3", "'Banana' has three syllables.": "audio/cau/c659c0c4c2415067.mp3", "In \"don't\", the letter t comes from not.": "audio/cau/549e7bc5a2456c75.mp3", "I didn't go out because I was tired.": "audio/cau/5cc7479c1b749e64.mp3", "Don't forget to take your umbrella.": "audio/cau/d1c93b06561e343d.mp3", "I take the bus to school; yesterday I took a taxi.": "audio/cau/6de67298648ceb25.mp3", "I often talk to my grandma on the phone.": "audio/cau/30262ea1745db608.mp3", "Lan is talkative; she loves to talk and chat with friends.": "audio/cau/ef14453a567466fc.mp3", "My little sister is very talkative.": "audio/cau/abe6afbd7c67a621.mp3", "He is shy, not talkative.": "audio/cau/c9c299a5fd04a0e9.mp3", "She got a tan at the beach.": "audio/cau/6d454b92cd6e645c.mp3", "Use suncream if you don't want a tan.": "audio/cau/41877782e69f2ff6.mp3", "Our English teacher is very kind.": "audio/cau/4869000a32bce322.mp3", "Ms Hoa taught us maths last year; she is a great teacher.": "audio/cau/01cfa396481f53ff.mp3", "The temperature today is 35 degrees.": "audio/cau/4ccb7417e160f652.mp3", "The nurse took my temperature.": "audio/cau/2792d455a023f825.mp3", "The traffic in the city is terrible today.": "audio/cau/01ea841928344884.mp3", "The food was terrible, but the view was wonderful.": "audio/cau/93b659e2b5f66a2e.mp3", "I'm terribly sorry for being late.": "audio/cau/32ca42d4f80bdb0d.mp3", "He sang terribly at the party.": "audio/cau/812ab7cd1e974ecb.mp3", "Thirdly, we should save water.": "audio/cau/a368bc621a56c1a0.mp3", "Thirdly, exercise keeps you healthy.": "audio/cau/5e62888bdcf24d9a.mp3", "Mum opened a tin of fish.": "audio/cau/5e651202e8c5abce.mp3", "We recycle old tins at school.": "audio/cau/d4330e1cfd8f5ea3.mp3", "It was a long and tiring day.": "audio/cau/0665fbc1cb4ea05d.mp3", "Climbing the mountain is tiring.": "audio/cau/71046ae4668b7317.mp3", "Lan is going to bed early tonight.": "audio/cau/082a4a419bcc862e.mp3", "If you stay up late tonight, you might feel tired tomorrow.": "audio/cau/67679aa3684d9212.mp3", "I totally agree with you.": "audio/cau/2ed025b410dc2507.mp3", "The town is totally different now; it changed completely.": "audio/cau/7c44b917714a1ef2.mp3", "I live in a small town near the sea.": "audio/cau/d1834f8b57570cad.mp3", "My town is bigger than my grandparents' village.": "audio/cau/5dce2eb178b20c1e.mp3", "We planted a tree in the schoolyard.": "audio/cau/7b5aaca07b018b07.mp3", "Birds are singing in the tree.": "audio/cau/2617b7ef451c2a57.mp3", "There are many old trees in my village.": "audio/cau/826dbf2b122a8fa0.mp3", "My grandfather planted this tree twenty years ago.": "audio/cau/dc3f88c985c7e66b.mp3", "An unbalanced diet is bad for your health.": "audio/cau/daf06455ac3f1742.mp3", "The table is unbalanced and wobbly.": "audio/cau/215072e457758a1c.mp3", "I'm unfit because I don't exercise.": "audio/cau/48a7bdd987b494e8.mp3", "This water is unfit to drink.": "audio/cau/7bdca57717421a46.mp3", "Eating fast food every day is unhealthy.": "audio/cau/40ffaf69ed1625bc.mp3", "Minh wants to give up his unhealthy habits.": "audio/cau/6ca9008a431e83bf.mp3", "Don't worry about unimportant things.": "audio/cau/f07810c695be3310.mp3", "This detail is unimportant.": "audio/cau/532d9addcc7fece9.mp3", "The writer of this song is unknown.": "audio/cau/34fd2674ae6ed3a3.mp3", "They travelled to unknown places.": "audio/cau/d5bf3d5c45b79db6.mp3", "Turn off unnecessary lights.": "audio/cau/5283f14f10a6242d.mp3", "Don't buy unnecessary things.": "audio/cau/3c196996ebaf5b8d.mp3", "The second syllable is unstressed.": "audio/cau/bc634ace1ecd6f53.mp3", "Unstressed vowels often sound like /ə/.": "audio/cau/68620d2fdffe0729.mp3", "It's unusual to see snow in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/e05b05b1ff1ae1b4.mp3", "She has an unusual name.": "audio/cau/8b34ff4e430332df.mp3", "Nam grew up in a small village.": "audio/cau/40830ead9e37bc73.mp3", "Lan walked up the hill and then came down.": "audio/cau/815acf6571d188ca.mp3", "We use computers to make our visual story.": "audio/cau/1f9e65093a2c0cf1.mp3", "This app is very useful, and I use it every day.": "audio/cau/7434eb2ec1577d85.mp3", "This dictionary is very useful.": "audio/cau/d616d82dd437efdf.mp3", "A computer is useful, but a broken one is useless.": "audio/cau/061aada006d6e574.mp3", "Spend your free time usefully.": "audio/cau/a5f343473daf5755.mp3", "Old bottles can be used usefully as pots.": "audio/cau/f80325fc53a6f5a0.mp3", "We talked about the usefulness of the Internet.": "audio/cau/1fa0f0d5fcdf7de1.mp3", "The usefulness of this tool is clear.": "audio/cau/a1f35dfbac0c1e29.mp3", "This broken umbrella is useless.": "audio/cau/87f4d5c1e27eee06.mp3", "It's useless to cry now.": "audio/cau/d2efa23c3f23f8b7.mp3", "Facebook has millions of users.": "audio/cau/3955ede83592bd40.mp3", "Enter your user name here.": "audio/cau/8f967e17a7ac312d.mp3", "I got up at the usual time.": "audio/cau/290a01bde4a43987.mp3", "As usual, she was late.": "audio/cau/dbda02aadf09e9b8.mp3", "I usually get up at six o'clock.": "audio/cau/56d7578c4454be93.mp3", "Mi usually walks to school, so it is unusual for her to be late.": "audio/cau/3e33c944667515e1.mp3", "How about + V-ing? How about going to the park?": "audio/cau/4bd32e061c4f1188.mp3", "In the formula, V means a verb, like 'go' or 'play'.": "audio/cau/2a5961c55ebdeb37.mp3", "We visited various places in Hue.": "audio/cau/42d60322c6ac295a.mp3", "The club has various activities.": "audio/cau/1d3dc86bfeda3837.mp3", "'Play' is a verb, but 'happy' is not.": "audio/cau/7cb0163f6a27d0af.mp3", "Underline the verb in each sentence.": "audio/cau/c45fa8ec83b8ba93.mp3", "Write the -ing form of these verbs.": "audio/cau/9a8d4d3f46f1577e.mp3", "'Run' and 'swim' are verbs; can you find one more verb?": "audio/cau/1cd8c87f9c695ab7.mp3", "My school is very big and beautiful.": "audio/cau/5cd4ea7091dbf666.mp3", "Thank you very much for your help.": "audio/cau/162955bdaf4118ee.mp3", "My grandparents live in a small village.": "audio/cau/959ff3761670ea0d.mp3", "The villagers in our village grow rice.": "audio/cau/c5c92b3fc554d83c.mp3", "The villagers are very friendly.": "audio/cau/83b65e1cf54c314b.mp3", "A villager showed us the way.": "audio/cau/8c99ee2c847588ae.mp3", "There are many craft villages near Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/9064f8b48096eb71.mp3", "Bat Trang is a famous pottery village.": "audio/cau/7212e9943aa25d4c.mp3", "There is a clock on the wall.": "audio/cau/db00df18f8f94a24.mp3", "The walls of my bedroom are blue.": "audio/cau/ae954897db5e658d.mp3", "The walls in my room are blue.": "audio/cau/5285e47b2e795058.mp3", "There are pictures on the walls.": "audio/cau/8b40b99da41f5339.mp3", "Global warming is a serious problem.": "audio/cau/61762974c67fd9de.mp3", "Planting trees can slow global warming.": "audio/cau/38636dc811dac0a4.mp3", "Nam was at home yesterday.": "audio/cau/faca1649a4ef8a76.mp3", "I was tired, but my friends were happy.": "audio/cau/e3e7c2c50296c48e.mp3", "Can I have some water, please?": "audio/cau/e7f9c90ffdf43ef9.mp3", "Hoa waters the plants with rainwater.": "audio/cau/63d57a63a01495bc.mp3", "This is the best way to learn new words.": "audio/cau/22b4d6bd5dcffca6.mp3", "Can you show me the way to the museum?": "audio/cau/a9eaac6ad2044743.mp3", "There are many ways to stay healthy.": "audio/cau/f79f902892e98e97.mp3", "Walking is a good way to keep fit.": "audio/cau/93a24eae327f3cdd.mp3", "Lan sings very well.": "audio/cau/8d831f0b90fa91ed.mp3", "Nam plays football well, but Phong plays better.": "audio/cau/7c13b2c077241009.mp3", "They were in Ha Noi last year.": "audio/cau/a884324b521a97cd.mp3", "I was at school, and my parents were at work.": "audio/cau/d6c97d0e9f2b3c05.mp3", "Where do you live, Lan?": "audio/cau/0c6d7d3df1a25694.mp3", "Where is my schoolbag, Mum?": "audio/cau/57a3c3d221996a0d.mp3", "Tuan tells a joke and the whole class laughs.": "audio/cau/72200be54ac56f1e.mp3", "We cleaned the whole house in one day.": "audio/cau/9e8c820037d2934c.mp3", "The new road is very wide.": "audio/cau/ca5d78940f527608.mp3", "The city will widen the narrow streets.": "audio/cau/73d72c9ffd031657.mp3", "English is widely spoken.": "audio/cau/e9a4f4da62f6ffdd.mp3", "This book is widely read in schools.": "audio/cau/9c5e8cb85b6a0c59.mp3", "The city plans to widen roads and build flyovers.": "audio/cau/350976526f3cce88.mp3", "This road is wide now because they widened it last year.": "audio/cau/f0b3c67484ac18ce.mp3", "The streets are wider than before.": "audio/cau/43e28d810d172739.mp3", "This road is wide, but that one is even wider.": "audio/cau/901cc573654e3536.mp3", "Measure the width of the table.": "audio/cau/61911ac7a0406d88.mp3", "The road is five metres in width.": "audio/cau/fb38cf72077a3c60.mp3", "Our team wants to win the match.": "audio/cau/e4c8afddb9e42c21.mp3", "Hoa won the prize, so she is the winner.": "audio/cau/2b49a5f49f82a8d5.mp3", "We had a wonderful holiday.": "audio/cau/b731d7b223c248dd.mp3", "What a wonderful idea!": "audio/cau/83d5b6cb831dd9a7.mp3", "Write the new word in your notebook.": "audio/cau/8b8bb3be1461f910.mp3", "This word has two syllables.": "audio/cau/3c07a10113a0df79.mp3", "Learn five new words every day.": "audio/cau/adb2b8f5372e6050.mp3", "Match the words with the pictures, one word for each picture.": "audio/cau/0c015f99a499421d.mp3", "My parents work in a hospital in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/4a34bda1f13dc400.mp3", "My uncle is a hard-working worker; he works every day.": "audio/cau/4fe31bc354d9e0c5.mp3", "She was one of the most famous scientists in the world.": "audio/cau/60bcc9b6651e1a00.mp3", "Pho is famous all over the world.": "audio/cau/5cc0d2280fff73e9.mp3", "Their products are sold worldwide.": "audio/cau/33dc1c140e6b7e3c.mp3", "This game is popular all over the world.": "audio/cau/6841bcd23e5d5707.mp3", "Mi is worried about her exam.": "audio/cau/646395233a7957de.mp3", "Don't worry, Nam; there's nothing to be worried about.": "audio/cau/bd1bb04640424333.mp3", "A daily routine helps Mai worry less about tests.": "audio/cau/2c0a6e39764b706b.mp3", "Don't worry, Nam. You have time to revise.": "audio/cau/c3373ec5399033ad.mp3", "She's always worrying about her physical health.": "audio/cau/31bb52a5e74ea080.mp3", "Stop worrying and get some sleep.": "audio/cau/f3f87a8929123518.mp3", "Please write your name here.": "audio/cau/a728b2e865ff5c76.mp3", "Mi likes to write, and she wrote a story yesterday.": "audio/cau/a907f42938059961.mp3", "My aunt is a writer.": "audio/cau/0b898dc7eb5824c9.mp3", "Mi wants to be a writer because she loves to write stories.": "audio/cau/5ce118b1d0da266b.mp3", "She was writing a book when I phoned her.": "audio/cau/97a3ce971a3a7562.mp3", "Mi is writing a letter, and she wrote one yesterday too.": "audio/cau/f5189e5fac049044.mp3", "Lan's answer was wrong, so she tried again.": "audio/cau/1b25a01594f7e8c8.mp3", "You look sad, Minh. What's wrong?": "audio/cau/bde31146d26c8a31.mp3", "He spelled my name wrongly.": "audio/cau/6f375b9c1ad0fc97.mp3", "She was wrongly blamed for the mistake.": "audio/cau/5c429e62a8f6c2c9.mp3", "Lie becomes lying: change 'ie' to y and add -ing.": "audio/cau/ccd0d01ed2295121.mp3", "The word 'yellow' begins with the letter y.": "audio/cau/413244207833f8bd.mp3"};
